      # Update verified sign-in
      #
      # Sets the sign-up verification level, the step-up rules, the claims your tokens carry and the workflows the
      # rules use. Each supplied rule updates only the fields you send for its kind. Omitted rules keep their
      # settings. Two rules of the same kind answer `duplicate_rule`, and `threshold` or `currency` on a rule other
      # than `payout` answer `not_supported`.
      #
      # +PATCH /organizations/{organization_id}/applications/{application_id}/authentication/verified/+
      #
      # @param organization_id [String] UUID of the organization that owns the application.
      # @param application_id [String] UUID of the application: live or sandbox. An API key configures its own
      #   application only.
