      # Verify the custom domain
      #
      # Checks the DNS record now and asks the edge for the certificate. A missing or mismatched DNS record returns
      # 200 with a `failure_reason`. Read `domain/` afterwards for the result: `verified` once the certificate is
      # issued, `failed` with a `failure_reason` when it cannot be issued.
      #
      # +POST /organizations/{organization_id}/applications/{application_id}/authentication/domain/verify/+
      #
      # @param organization_id [String] UUID of the organization that owns the application.
